  <2>2. BasesS' = BasesS BY <1>u, <1>z DEF BasesS, InSyncR
  <2>3. BasesS \subseteq R BY <1>0, <1>T DEF BasesS, InSyncR
  <2>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in BasesS', NEW f \in sPres'[q], f >= nextSeq' \/ ~conf'[f], NEW x \in Blocks
