  <2>na. NewAnc(r, cutK) = {cutK} \cup (IF hPar[r] = 0 THEN {} ELSE anc[r][hPar[r]]) BY DEF NewAnc, AncOf
  \* every snapshot after the step is at most cutK
  <2>le. \A q \in R : \A f \in sPres'[q] : f \in Nat /\ f <= cutK
    <3>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in R, NEW f \in sPres'[q] PROVE f \in Nat /\ f <= cutK OBVIOUS
    <3>1. CASE q = r BY <3>1, <2>n, <1>a, <1>k, <1>N
    <3>2. CASE q # r BY <3>2, <2>m, <1>a, <1>k, <1>N
    <3>. QED BY <3>1, <3>2
  \* a snapshot other than the new one keeps its content and its acked map
  <2>old. \A q \in R : \A f \in sPres'[q] : ~(q = r /\ f = cutK) =>
