  <2>5. I_WHiS'
    <3>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q1 \in R, NEW q2 \in R, NEW e1 \in sPres'[q1], NEW e2 \in sPres'[q2], e1 < e2,
                        NEW x \in Blocks
                 PROVE  cutAck'[q1][e1][x] <= cutAck'[q2][e2][x]
      BY DEF I_WHiS
    <3>0. e1 \in Nat /\ e2 \in Nat /\ e2 <= cutK BY <2>le
