    <3>. QED BY <3>3, <3>4
  <2>5a. I_AckMono'
    <3>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in R, NEW f \in sPres'[q], NEW x \in Blocks PROVE cutAck'[q][f][x] <= acked[x]
      BY <1>u DEF I_AckMono
    <3>1. CASE q = r /\ f = cutK BY <3>1, <2>n, <1>N
    <3>2. CASE ~(q = r /\ f = cutK)
