  <2>6. I_HeadLoS'
    <3>1. \A q \in R : CatchingUp(q)' = CatchingUp(q) /\ HiOf(q)' = HiOf(q) BY <1>u DEF CatchingUp, HiOf
    <3>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in R, CatchingUp(q), NEW q1 \in R, NEW p \in sPres'[q1], p < HiOf(q),
