      <4>. QED BY <4>1, <4>2
    <3>3. I_FreshS2'
      <4>0. InSyncR' = InSyncR /\ InSyncR \subseteq R BY <1>u, <1>T DEF InSyncR
      <4>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in InSyncR \cap rmemA, NEW f \in sPres'[q], f >= nextSeq \/ ~conf[f],
